00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.600
And I know, I think I know what this is.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.453
The "Friends" Thanksgiving Trifle.

00:05:53.571 --> 00:05:54.404
(Katie laughs)

00:05:54.404 --> 00:05:55.495
- Mm.
(Katie laughs)

00:05:55.495 --> 00:05:56.328
- [Katie] You have three options.

00:05:56.328 --> 00:05:59.210
Would you go to the balcony
and a bird takes this,

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.300
would you go to the bathroom

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.390
to watch yourself eat it in the mirror,

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.090
or would you down it like Joey?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.320
Or does it taste like feet?

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.780
- I would definitely watch
myself eat it in the bathroom.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.480
The reactions on the TV
show was very accurate.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.670
- Here we go.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.692
- [ Jasmine] You excited?

00:06:15.692 --> 00:06:16.525
- I'm excited.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:19.580
- [Jasmine] I think she likes it.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:22.360
- What an adventure. The end
of it tastes like a burger.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:23.400
Do I like this?

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.607
- [Jasmine] Okay, Katie,
you have three options.

00:06:24.607 --> 00:06:27.320
- I'm gonna down it
like Joey. I'm shocked.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.610
Kelly, you got to try this.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.100
- This is one of my favorite episodes

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.210
I've ever watched from "Friends".

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.160
I have never wanted to try this though.

00:06:34.757 --> 00:06:35.937
Mm-mm. I hate it.

00:06:35.937 --> 00:06:38.099
- [Katie] You got three
options. Are you crying?

00:06:38.099 --> 00:06:39.863
- Yeah. I'm going to the balcony.

00:06:39.863 --> 00:06:41.600
It's going right over.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.290
Hopefully into a trashcan
