00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.123
But this has to go.

00:06:45.123 --> 00:06:46.960
- So based on everyone's reaction,

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:50.890
I am taking away that
it's absolutely delicious.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.680
It's really good, actually.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.620
It tastes like french
fries in a milkshake.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.020
I would down this like Joey.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.400
I am downing it like Joey.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:02.900
I am so happy I finally
got to satisfy my curiosity

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.120
after so many years.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.650
This was actually really good.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.340
So I now know, for certain,

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:09.670
